  "description": "Sticky notes for Claude Code. Write memos in a Markdown file — URLs, ideas, TODOs, anything. Claude reads, organizes by category, and acts on them (opens URLs, runs checks, marks done). No app needed, just a Markdown file + a skill definition.",
